### Sales Order API Testing

### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### List All Sales Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Sales Orders with Filters
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?page=1&limit=10&status=DRAFT&customerName=John
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Sales Order by ID
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Sales Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "orderDate": "2024-01-15",
  "deliveryDate": "2024-01-20",
  "notes": "Urgent delivery requested",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 100.00,
      "discountPercent": 5,
      "taxPercent": 10,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1,
      "notes": "Premium quality item"
    },
    {
      "itemId": 2,
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "discountPercent": 0,
      "taxPercent": 10,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### Update Sales Order (DRAFT only)
PATCH {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe Updated",
  "deliveryDate": "2024-01-21",
  "notes": "Updated notes",
  "discountAmount": 50.00,
  "taxAmount": 25.00
}

###

### Confirm Sales Order (Allocate Stock)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Order confirmed for immediate processing",
  "approvedBy": 1
}

###

### Ship Sales Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2/ship
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Shipped via express delivery",
  "shippedBy": 1
}

###

### Deliver Items for Sales Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2/deliver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveredItems": [
    {
      "orderItemId": 1,
      "deliveredQuantity": 10
    },
    {
      "orderItemId": 2,
      "deliveredQuantity": 3
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Items delivered successfully",
  "deliveredBy": 1
}

###

### Cancel Sales Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation",
  "notes": "Will refund payment within 5 business days"
}

###

### Delete Sales Order (DRAFT only)
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search Sales Orders by Order Number
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?orderNo=SO-2026-0001
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Filter Sales Orders by Date Range
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?orderDateFrom=2026-01-01&orderDateTo=2026-01-31
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Sort Sales Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?sortBy=orderDate&sortOrder=ASC
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get CONFIRMED Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?status=CONFIRMED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get SHIPPED Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?status=SHIPPED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get DELIVERED Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?status=DELIVERED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get CANCELLED Orders
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?status=CANCELLED
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create Sales Order with Single Item
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "orderDate": "2024-01-16",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 1,
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 500.00,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### Confirm Order without Notes
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Ship Order without Notes
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4/ship
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Partial Delivery
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/2/deliver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveredItems": [
    {
      "orderItemId": 3,
      "deliveredQuantity": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Partial delivery, remaining to follow"
}

###

### Test Error - Create Order with Invalid Item
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "orderDate": "2024-01-16",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": 99999,
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitOfMeasureId": 1,
      "unitPrice": 100.00,
      "warehouseId": 1,
      "locationId": 1
    }
  ]
}

