### Test Error - Confirm Non-Draft Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "This should fail if order is not DRAFT"
}

###

### Test Error - Deliver Non-Shipped Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4/deliver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveredItems": [
    {
      "orderItemId": 1,
      "deliveredQuantity": 5
    }
  ]
}

###

### Test Error - Deliver More Than Ordered
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4/deliver
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveredItems": [
    {
      "orderItemId": 1,
      "deliveredQuantity": 100
    }
  ]
}

###

### Test Error - Cancel Delivered Order
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Trying to cancel delivered order"
}

###

### Test Error - Delete Non-Draft Order
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders/4
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Pagination - Page 2
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?page=2&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Complex Filters
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/ops/sales-orders?status=CONFIRMED&customerName=John&orderDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC
Content-Type: application/json
